#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.view_page_become_a_member
msgid ""
"<br/>For those discovering the club. Access to the essentials, perfect for "
"getting acquainted with the space."
msgstr ""
"<br/>ສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ກຳລັງຄົ້ນພົບສະໂມສອນ. ເຂົ້າເຖິງສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ເໝາະສຳລັບການທຳຄວາມລຶ້ງເຄີຍກັບສະຖານທີ່."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.view_page_become_a_member
msgid ""
"<br/>For those who see the club as a second home. Full access, priority "
"booking and dedicated support."
msgstr ""
"<br/>ສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ຖືວ່າສະໂມສອນເປັນເຮືອນຫຼັງທີສອງ. ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ເຕັມຮູບແບບ, ໄດ້ຮັບສິດຈອງກ່ອນ ແລະ ການຊ່ວຍ"
"ເຫຼືອສະເພາະ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.view_page_become_a_member
msgid ""
"<br/>The essentials of the Members tier, renewed automatically every year at "
"a lower rate."
msgstr ""
"<br/>ສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນຂອງລະດັບສະມາຊິກ, ຕໍ່ອາຍຸອັດຕະໂນມັດທຸກໆປີໃນລາຄາທີ່ຖືກກວ່າ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:members_club.blog_post_3
msgid ""
"<em>Curious what a week inside the club looks like? We'd love to show you.</"
"em>"
msgstr ""
"<em>ຢາກຮູ້ບໍ່ວ່າໜຶ່ງອາທິດຢູ່ໃນສະໂມສອນເປັນແນວໃດ? ພວກເຮົາຢາກພາທ່ານໄປເບິ່ງ.</em>"

