#. module: members_club
#: model:product.template,description_sale:members_club.product_template_4
msgid ""
"For those discovering the club. Access to the essentials, perfect for "
"getting acquainted with the space."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ກຳລັງຄົ້ນພົບສະໂມສອນ. ເຂົ້າເຖິງສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ເໝາະສຳລັບການທຳຄວາມລຶ້ງເຄີຍກັບສະຖານທີ່."

#. module: members_club
#: model:product.template,description_sale:members_club.product_template_6
msgid ""
"For those who see the club as a second home. Full access, priority booking "
