#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Host unforgettable events with the Events app, fully connected with your CRM "
"and website."
msgstr "ຈັດງານກິດຈະກຳທີ່ໜ້າຈົດຈຳດ້ວຍແອັບ Events ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ CRM ແລະ ເວັບໄຊຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງສົມບູນ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.view_page_contactus
msgid "House Manager"
msgstr "ຜູ້ຈັດການເຮືອນສະໂມສອນ"

#. module: members_club
#: model:blog.post,subtitle:members_club.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"How a simple breathing workshop helped our members rediscover presence, "
"purpose, and calm"
msgstr ""
"ເວີກຊັອບການຝຶກຫາຍໃຈງ່າຍໆ ໄດ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສະມາຊິກຂອງພວກເຮົາຄົ້ນພົບສະຕິ, ເປົ້າໝາຍ, ແລະ "
"ຄວາມສະຫງົບຄືນມາໄດ້ແນວໃດ"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.view_page_home
msgid ""
"I come alone most weekends, just to read by the window with a coffee. No one "
"bothers you, no one expects anything from you. It's rare to find <em>a space "
"that respects silence</em> as much as this one does."
msgstr ""
"ຂ້ອຍມັກມາຄົນດຽວເກືອບທຸກທ້າຍອາທິດ, ພຽງແຕ່ນັ່ງອ່ານໜັງສືຢູ່ຂ້າງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມພ້ອມກາເຟຈອກໜຶ່ງ. ບໍ່ມີໃຜມາລົບກວນ, "
"ບໍ່ມີໃຜຄາດຫວັງຫຍັງຈາກເຈົ້າ. ມັນຍາກທີ່ຈະຊອກຫາ <em>ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເຄົາລົບຄວາມງຽບສະຫງົບ</em> ໄດ້ຄືກັບບ່ອນນີ້."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.view_page_home
msgid ""
"I've hosted three client dinners here now, and every single one has gone "
"better than expected. There's something about <em>the setting that puts "
"people at ease</em> before a word is even said."
msgstr ""
"ຂ້ອຍເຄີຍຈັດງານລ້ຽງອາຫານຄ່ຳໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ມາແລ້ວສາມຄັ້ງ, ແລະ ທຸກໆຄັ້ງລ້ວນແຕ່ອອກມາດີເກີນຄາດ. ມີບາງຢ່າງ"
"ກ່ຽວກັບ <em>ບັນຍາກາດທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄົນຮູ້ສຶກຜ່ອນຄາຍ</em> ຕັ້ງແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ເລີ່ມລົມກັນເລີຍ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.view_page_home
msgid ""
"I've lived in Brussels my whole life and never knew a place like this "
"existed. Walking through the park and into the club <em>feels like stepping "
"into another era</em>. It's become my favorite place to disconnect."
msgstr ""
"ຂ້ອຍອາໄສຢູ່ໃນບຣຸກແຊນມາຕະຫຼອດຊີວິດ ແລະ ບໍ່ເຄີຍຮູ້ມາກ່ອນວ່າມີສະຖານທີ່ແບບນີ້ຢູ່. ການຍ່າງຜ່ານສວນສາທາລະນະ"
"ເຂົ້າມາໃນສະໂມສອນ <em>ຮູ້ສຶກຄືກັບການຍ່າງກ້າວເຂົ້າສູ່ອີກຍຸກໜຶ່ງ</em>. ມັນໄດ້ກາຍເປັນບ່ອນທີ່ຂ້ອຍມັກທີ່ສຸດໃນກາ"
"ນຕັດຂາດຈາກໂລກພາຍນອກ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you want to easily discover every features of this package, try "
"downloading the Demo Data."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄົ້ນພົບທຸກໆຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງແພັກເກດນີ້ໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ, ລອງດາວໂຫຼດ Demo Data."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Increase perceived value by combining memberships with exclusive items or "
"access to special events using <strong>eCommerce</strong> and "
"<strong>Events</strong> apps. Create attractive bundles to sell directly on "
"your website."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມມູນຄ່າທີ່ຮັບຮູ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລວມສະມາຊິກເຂົ້າກັບສິນຄ້າພິເສດ ຫຼື ການເຂົ້າຮ່ວມງານພິເສດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ແອັບ "
"<strong>eCommerce</strong> ແລະ <strong>Events</strong>. "
"ສ້າງແພັກເກດທີ່ໜ້າສົນໃຈເພື່ອຂາຍໂດຍກົງໃນເວັບໄຊຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:members_club.blog_post_2
msgid ""
"Interiors that carry the character of another era, without ever feeling like "
"a museum"
msgstr ""
"ການຕົກແຕ່ງພາຍໃນທີ່ສະທ້ອນເຖິງກິ່ນອາຍຂອງອີກຍຸກສະໄໝໜຶ່ງ ໂດຍບໍ່ຮູ້ສຶກຄືກັບຫໍພິພິທະພັນເລີຍ"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.view_page_contactus
msgid "John Doe"
msgstr "John Doe"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.view_page_become_a_member
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Join our <span class=\"text-o-color-2\">vibrant community</span><br/>\n"
"                                            for exclusive events and "
"networking!"
msgstr ""
"ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມ <span class=\"text-o-color-2\">ຊຸມຊົນທີ່ມີຊີວິດຊີວາ</span> ຂອງພວກເຮົາ<br/>\n"
"                                            ສຳລັບກິດຈະກຳພິເສດ ແລະ ການສ້າງເຄືອຂ່າຍ!"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.view_page_home
msgid "Join the waitlist"
msgstr "ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມລາຍຊື່ລໍຖ້າ"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:event.event,description:members_club.event_event_1
msgid ""
"Join us for an inspiring evening with <strong>Isla Kendrew</strong>, a "
"former humanitarian strategist turned innovation consultant whose work has "
"spanned over 30 countries. Isla has advised global nonprofits, early-stage "
"startups, and Fortune 500 leaders on how to stay creative and effective in "
"times of uncertainty."
msgstr ""
"ຮ່ວມເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງໃນຄ່ຳຄືນທີ່ສ້າງແຮງບັນດານໃຈກັບ <strong>Isla Kendrew</strong>, "
"ອະດີດນັກຍຸດທະສາດດ້ານມະນຸດສະທຳ ທີ່ຜັນຕົວມາເປັນທີ່ປຶກສາດ້ານນະວັດຕະກຳ ເຊິ່ງມີຜົນງານໃນຫຼາຍກວ່າ 30 "
"ປະເທດ. Isla ໄດ້ໃຫ້ຄຳປຶກສາແກ່ອົງການບໍ່ຫວັງຜົນກຳໄລລະດັບໂລກ, ທຸລະກິດສະຕາດອັບໄລຍະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແລະ "
"ຜູ້ນຳລະດັບ Fortune 500 ກ່ຽວກັບວິທີຮັກສາຄວາມຄິດສ້າງສັນ ແລະ ປະສິດທິຜົນໃນຍຸກແຫ່ງຄວາມບໍ່ແນ່ນອນ."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.view_page_contactus
msgid "Julien Delacroix"
msgstr "Julien Delacroix"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:members_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Just be careful, once demo data are uploaded, it cannot be easily deleted. "
"But you can restart a fresh database on"
msgstr ""
"ພຽງແຕ່ຄວນລະວັງ, ເມື່ອອັບໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງແລ້ວ, ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບອອກໄດ້ງ່າຍ. "
"ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມຖານຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ໄດ້ທີ່"

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:event.event,description:members_club.event_event_1
msgid ""
"Known for her calm presence and thought-provoking insights, Isla brings a "
"rare perspective on leadership, resilience, and finding clarity when the "
"path ahead is unclear. Her TEDx talk, <em>“When the Map Disappears,”</em> "
"has resonated with thousands seeking purpose in unpredictable times."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍບຸກຄະລິກທີ່ສະຫງົບ ແລະ ມຸມມອງທີ່ກະຕຸ້ນຄວາມຄິດ, Isla ນຳເອົາມຸມມອງທີ່ຫາຍາກກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມເປັນຜູ້ນຳ, "
"ຄວາມອົດທົນເຂັ້ມແຂງ, ແລະ ການຄົ້ນຫາຄວາມຊັດເຈນໃນຍາມທີ່ເສັ້ນທາງຂ້າງໜ້າມືດມົວ. ການບັນຍາຍ TEDx "
"ຂອງລາວ, <em>“When the Map Disappears,”</em> "
"ໄດ້ສ້າງແຮງບັນດານໃຈໃຫ້ກັບຄົນນັບພັນທີ່ກຳລັງຊອກຫາເປົ້າໝາຍໃນຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ຄາດເດົາບໍ່ໄດ້."

#. module: members_club
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:members_club.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"Last Thursday evening, the lights in the library room were dimmed, the noise "
"of the city left at the door, and a circle of cushions awaited curious "
"members ready to explore something a little outside their usual rhythm: "
"stillness."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແລງວັນພະຫັດທີ່ຜ່ານມາ, ໄຟໃນຫ້ອງສະໝຸດຖືກຫຼີ່ໃຫ້ສະຫຼົວລົງ, ສຽງລົບກວນຂອງເມືອງໃຫຍ່ຖືກປະໄວ້ຢູ່ນອກປະຕູ, "
"ແລະ ວົງມົນຂອງໝອນຮອງນັ່ງໄດ້ລໍຖ້າຕ້ອນຮັບສະມາຊິກຜູ້ຢາກຮຽນຮູ້ "
"ທີ່ພ້ອມຈະສຳຫຼວດສິ່ງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງໄປຈາກຈັງຫວະຊີວິດເດີມໆ: ຄວາມສະຫງົບງຽບ."

